                <pb facs="0748" n="652" xml:id="pg652"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 3.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">His Imperial Majesty’s reply to Mr.
                    Bingham.</hi></head>
                <p>We are most happy to receive this letter from the President of the United States’
                    announcing to us that yon have been selected and commissioned envoy
                    extraordinary and minister plenipotentiary accredited to this court.</p>
                <p>We have full confidence that in fulfilling the functions intrusted to you, you
                    will use your best endeavors, guided by experience, fidelity, and probity, to
                    increase friendship between both nations and to advance our mutual
                    interests.</p>
                <p>Our ardent wishes and hopes are that your country may continuously be in peace
                    and prosperity.</p>
            </div>
